{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/extras/61747a29f2d4819b01c2397e58c6a090.avif?t=1764626868\" width=1200 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/extras/3f07201bf49ce259c6e89d1e38b62a3a.avif?t=1764626868\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/extras_big/3f07201bf49ce259c6e89d1e38b62a3a.webp?t=1764626868 width=1560 height=411 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of Wunderhause is a constantly evolving and changing first person psychological horror game following Royland Harker, a washed-up journalist at a dying paper looking for any story to save his legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious informant points Roy to the infamous <i>Wunderhause Studio, A cold case mystery still fueling rumors and dread even 7 years after its closure.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/extras/d262f5d7c147a9e76b05661db15b233a.avif?t=1764626868\" width=973 height=1590 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desperate for a story, You will step inside to uncover what was hidden, and why it was buried for so long.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oblivious to your true situation, you will be met with horrors and carnage throughout your ill-fated stay at the previously renowned film studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> vigilance is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An evolving narrative:</strong> Choices and exploration reveal new layers of Roy\u2019s past, and the studio\u2019s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling:</strong>\u00a0Descend deeper and reveal the truth behind Wunderhause\u2019s downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror:</strong> Reality distorts as you venture deeper into the long forgotten studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/extras/1755ef76cf6aa39ab387b85b9bc49cd3.avif?t=1764626868\" width=1200 height=110 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047510?t=1764626868","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/30c3951b06af942bfebdea7820036680eb4484a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764626868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/5047f401dd4344917c9806d1cfa111d1a3898de4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764626868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/5047f401dd4344917c9806d1cfa111d1a3898de4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764626868","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><