es</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An evolving narrative:</strong> Choices and exploration reveal new layers of Roy\u2019s past, and the studio\u2019s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling:</strong>\u00a0Descend deeper and reveal the truth behind Wunderhause\u2019s downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror:</strong> Reality distorts as you venture deeper into the long forgotten studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/extras/1755ef76cf6aa39ab387b85b9bc49cd3.avif?t=1764626868\" width=1200 height=110 /></span></p>","developers":["Polygremlin","DiamondRaider","Noirgami"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047510/99f4889c88033b8f6e6e25b289b33df7e798a9b5/header.jpg?t=1764626868","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047510/937609283/9a2a11487f8c5272c735875c2717f0321c262727/1764345926/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764626867","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047510/937609283/9a2a11487f8c5272c735875c2717f0321c262727/1764345926/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764626867","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047510/937609283/9a2a11487f8c5272c735875c2717f0321c262727/1764345926/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764626867","id":257214551,"name":"Wunderhause Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214551/56358433100b85bd563